# Never commit TLS private keys or certificates (SEC-020).
# This directory is mounted read-only into the nginx container at
# /etc/nginx/certs/ and read by console.conf. Drop these two files here:
#   console.crt  — fullchain certificate for console.lumina.1t.ru
#   console.key  — matching private key (chmod 0400)
# Generate a local-dev self-signed pair with:
#   openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes -days 365 \
#     -keyout console.key -out console.crt -subj "/CN=console.lumina.1t.ru"
*
!.gitignore
